**Last line of the STATUS FILE, exactly one of:** `RECORDS COMMITTED: records/b1055 @ <sha40> | PR #<n> merged as <sha40> | <3 or 4> C-entries (<numbers>), <n> BACKLOG rows, 1 history entry, <0 to 3> catch-up files | Jira: 2 tickets (<keys>), 2 label adds, 17 comments, <n> transitions (<keys or none>), 0 edits | SKIPS <...> HELD <...> | PRIOR WORK section present`; `RECORDS PUSHED: ... | PR not landed (<reason>) | ...`; `RECORDS DONE: nothing to push (<reason>) | Jira: ...`; or `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY` with ONE question.

